ng**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_040be241fe85dfa7016a9b6311541887d0baec32f4f36b58f3","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","seq":12187,"startedSeq":11917,"endedSeq":12187,"timestamp":"1788568351Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"安全合同排除了刚才考虑的“持久 cookie 摘要充当设备身份”方案：设计明确要求本地 cookie 短期、Remote 每设备独立身份，而完整 challenge-response/Noise 属于 Stage 5。不能为满足 Stage 4 的 SSH pairing 文案提前造一个长期 bearer 兼容层。\n\nStage 4 的最小边界因此保持为 SSH 管理信道辅助的本地 launch：安装/启动/隧道完成后，通过不落盘的 SSH 控制通道向**正在运行的 Host 进程**请求一次性 token，浏览器交换成短期 cookie。该 IPC 必须是进程内本地管理通道，不能由第二个进程自行签 token，也不能出现在 systemd 日志、参数或环境。这个跨进程通道与实际 Ubuntu 验证需要一起实现；在此之前不把现有 tunnel 标为“已配对”。\n\n我先完成与此独立、且同样阻断 Stage 4 的 Web/REST 明确缺口：安全搜索高亮、Diff、队列重排、Provider Profile durable 管理和 PWA 非敏感缓存；之后再回到 SSH IPC，以免把认证边界与 UI 状态混在一次改动中。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_OuB6gFxWPyPBv2oPaA9GxOFj","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\web\\app\\src\\App.tsx (220 - 399)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_OuB6gFxWPyPBv2oPaA9GxOFj","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","seq":12191,"startedSeq":12188,"endedSeq":12191,"timestamp":"1788568361Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_FevKu41Wd3mLo87o3KYvFgMC","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\web\\app\\public\\sw.js","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_FevKu41Wd3mLo87o3KYvFgMC","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","seq":12195,"startedSeq":12194,"endedSeq":12195,"timestamp":"1788568361Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_Y1qj7cr2BMepNe7qfOCOhudR","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\web\\app\\public\\manifest.webmanifest","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_Y1qj7cr2BMepNe7qfOCOhudR","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","seq":12199,"startedSeq":12196,"endedS